VALUES ('dc91263e-cdfc-507c-a858-bd2f42248935', 'Return Disposition Status', 'Maintain Return Disposition Status records', 'Create, find and maintain Return Disposition Status records. The list shows every Return Disposition Status you have access to — select a row to open it, or use New to add one. Each row is a single Return Disposition Status, described by 6 fields.

